cting chemical analysis to determine the chemical purity of the sample.\"},\"attributes\":[{\"type\":\"float\",\"name\":\"Chemical Purity\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Chemical Purity: float between 0.0 and 100.0' represents the percentage of chemical purity determined from the chemical analysis.\",\"min_value\":0.0,\"max_value\":100.0,\"enumeration_values\":null}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Perform Chemical Analysis: Chemical Purity' connects the 'Perform Chemical Analysis' activity to the attribute 'Chemical Purity'.\"},{\"activity\":{\"name\":\"Calibrate Equipment\",\"description\":\"The 'Calibrate Equipment' activity involves calibrating the testing equipment to ensure accurate measurements.\"},\"attributes\":[{\"type\":\"enumeration\",\"name\":\"Equipment Status\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Equipment Status: Calibrated, Not Calibrated' specifies whether the equipment is Calibrated or Not Calibrated prior to conducting tests.\",\"min_value\":null,\"max_value\":null,\"enumeration_values\":[\"Calibrated\",\"Not Calibrated\"]}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Calibrate Equipment: Equipment Status' specifies that the activity 'Calibrate Equipment' requires the attribute 'Equipment Status'.\"}],\"constraints\":[{\"type\":\"unary\",\"description\":\"The 'Prepare Sample' must be the first activity to occur in the process.\",\"template\":\"Init\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Prepare Sample\",\"description\":\"The 'Prepare Sample' activity represents the initial preparation phase for the material sample to be tested.\"},\"target\":null,\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"unary\",\"description\":\"The 'Approve Material' must be the last activity to occur in the process.\",\"template\":\"End\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Approve Material\",\"description\":\"The 'Approve Material' activity includes approving the material based on the review of findings.\"},\"target\":null,\"activation_co